{
 "id": "reading-banked-nouns",
 "title": "名词空位与数量限制",
 "goal": "识别名词空位并根据限定词和语境选择名词形式。",
 "skill": "阅读",
 "exam": "大学英语四级（CET-4）",
 "mastery": "once",
 "points": [
  {
   "id": "slot",
   "label": "识别需要名词的句法位置"
  },
  {
   "id": "number",
   "label": "按限定词和语境选择名词形式"
  }
 ],
 "sources": [
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "title": "全国大学英语四、六级考试大纲（2016年修订版）",
   "url": "https://cet.neea.edu.cn/res/Home/1704/55b02330ac17274664f06d9d3db8249d.pdf",
   "used": "词汇理解教学依据"
  }
 ],
 "cards": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "text",
   "title": "概述",
   "body": [
    {
     "p": "名词在句中作主语或宾语。空位前是限定词、形容词或介词时，空位通常要填名词。"
    },
    {
     "p": "名词的形式还要和数量相符。a、an 后用单数可数名词，如 an idea；much 后用不可数名词，如 much information。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "positions",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "名词的位置",
   "cols": [
    "位置",
    "例一",
    "例二"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "限定词后",
     "The plan changed.",
     "An idea emerged."
    ],
    [
     "形容词后",
     "A useful tool saves time.",
     "Fresh bread smells good."
    ],
    [
     "动词宾语",
     "The guide opened the gate.",
     "The artist painted a wall."
    ],
    [
     "介词宾语",
     "The key is under the book.",
     "They talked about a project."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "quantity",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "数量和可数性",
   "cols": [
    "线索",
    "形式",
    "例"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "a、an、each",
     "单数可数名词",
     "Each student has a notebook."
    ],
    [
     "many、several",
     "复数可数名词",
     "Several students took notes."
    ],
    [
     "much",
     "不可数名词",
     "The guide gave much information."
    ],
    [
     "two、three 等",
     "复数可数名词",
     "Two chairs stood by the door."
    ],
    [
     "some",
     "复数或不可数名词",
     "Some books contain useful information."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "forms",
   "type": "table",
   "title": "名词和动词同形",
   "cols": [
    "词",
    "名词",
    "动词"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "plan",
     "The plan needs work.",
     "They plan a meeting."
    ],
    [
     "change",
     "The change helped residents.",
     "Seasons change gradually."
    ],
    [
     "visit",
     "The visit lasted an hour.",
     "Guests visit the museum."
    ],
    [
     "water",
     "The water is clean.",
     "Workers water the plants."
    ]
   ],
   "note": "同形词的词性看它在句中的位置：在 the 后是名词，在主语后作谓语是动词。"
  },
  {
   "id": "worked",
   "type": "text",
   "title": "例题",
   "body": [
    {
     "box": "The librarian gave each visitor a useful _____.\n1. guide\n2. guides\n3. helpful\n4. guiding"
    },
    {
     "p": "a useful 后要用单数可数名词。第一项 guide 意为指南，符合句意。第二项 guides 是复数，不能跟在 a 后面。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "check-one",
   "type": "check",
   "title": "练习一",
   "points": [
    "slot",
    "number"
   ],
   "groups": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "stem": "The _____ was discussed at the meeting.",
       "options": [
        "plan",
        "planned",
        "plans",
        "busy"
       ],
       "answer": 0,
       "why": "The 后的空位作主语，要填名词。谓语是单数 was，所以用 plan，不用复数 plans。",
       "point": "slot"
      },
      {
       "stem": "The worker placed a heavy _____ beside the door.",
       "options": [
        "carry",
        "box",
        "heavy",
        "carefully"
       ],
       "answer": 1,
       "why": "a heavy 后需要单数名词，box 符合句意。",
       "point": "slot"
      },
      {
       "stem": "Each guest received one _____.",
       "options": [
        "tickets",
        "information",
        "ticket",
        "advice"
       ],
       "answer": 2,
       "why": "one 后接单数可数名词 ticket。",
       "point": "number"
      },
      {
       "stem": "The guide gave visitors much _____ about the park.",
       "options": [
        "maps",
        "routes",
        "notices",
        "information"
       ],
       "answer": 3,
       "why": "much 修饰不可数名词 information。",
       "point": "number"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "check-two",
   "type": "check",
   "title": "练习二",
   "points": [
    "slot",
    "number"
   ],
   "groups": [
    {
     "look": "passage",
     "text": "A neighborhood group planned a clean-up. Several volunteers brought bags, and each person received a pair of gloves. After the work, they discussed another plan for the street.",
     "items": [
      {
       "stem": "After the work, the volunteers discussed a new _____.",
       "options": [
        "clean",
        "plan",
        "planned",
        "planning"
       ],
       "answer": 1,
       "why": "discussed 的宾语前有 a new，故选单数名词 plan。",
       "point": "slot"
      },
      {
       "stem": "Several _____ brought bags to the clean-up.",
       "options": [
        "person",
        "glove",
        "volunteers",
        "work"
       ],
       "answer": 2,
       "why": "原文是 Several volunteers brought bags。several 后接复数可数名词，即 volunteers。",
       "point": "number"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "timed",
   "type": "quiz",
   "title": "小测",
   "minutes": 6,
   "pass": 0.8,
   "points": [
    "slot",
    "number"
   ],
   "sets": [
    {
     "id": "set-a",
     "groups": [
      {
       "items": [
        {
         "stem": "The _____ was useful during the tour of the building.",
         "options": [
          "guide",
          "guided",
          "useful",
          "guides"
         ],
         "answer": 0,
         "why": "The 后的空位作主语，要填名词。谓语是单数 was，所以用 guide，不用复数 guides。",
         "point": "slot"
        },
        {
         "stem": "The artist chose a bright _____ for the wall.",
         "options": [
          "painted",
          "color",
          "bright",
          "colorful"
         ],
         "answer": 1,
         "why": "a bright 后需要名词；color 作 chose 的宾语。",
         "point": "slot"
        },
        {
         "stem": "The visitors walked through the _____.",
         "options": [
          "opened",
          "walking",
          "gate",
          "wide"
         ],
         "answer": 2,
         "why": "介词 through 后的 the 引出名词短语，空位要填名词 gate。",
         "point": "slot"
        },
        {
         "stem": "The gardener repaired the _____ before the rain.",
         "options": [
          "repairing",
          "wooden",
          "repaired",
          "fence"
         ],
         "answer": 3,
         "why": "repaired 后的 the 引出宾语；fence 是名词。",
         "point": "slot"
        },
        {
         "stem": "Each student received a _____.",
         "options": [
          "notebook",
          "notebooks",
          "notes",
          "information"
         ],
         "answer": 0,
         "why": "a 后接单数可数名词 notebook。",
         "point": "number"
        },
        {
         "stem": "The report included several _____.",
         "options": [
          "example",
          "examples",
          "information",
          "advice"
         ],
         "answer": 1,
         "why": "several 后接复数可数名词 examples。",
         "point": "number"
        },
        {
         "stem": "There was much _____ about the project in the report.",
         "options": [
          "details",
          "reports",
          "information",
          "plans"
         ],
         "answer": 2,
         "why": "much 修饰不可数名词 information。",
         "point": "number"
        },
        {
         "stem": "Two _____ were placed near the table.",
         "options": [
          "chair",
          "furniture",
          "seat",
          "chairs"
         ],
         "answer": 3,
         "why": "two 后接复数可数名词 chairs。",
         "point": "number"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
